# The reasons a check could not be made and the causes a registry kind was
# left out in a run, as a recorded result carries them (criterion 24 of
# itd-2611211024360819). A release may add a line and never rename or remove
# one: TestIdentifiersOnlyGrow fails on a line the package no longer encodes,
# and on an identifier the package encodes that no line here holds.
#
# One "<set> <identifier>" per line.

reason unreadable
reason unreachable
reason tool_missing
reason timed_out
reason check_failed
cause host_run
cause other_run
cause not_armed
cause nothing_to_read
